{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"linguistic-dental-eyra","creation_channel":"mcp","description":"## Context / Problem\nThe tests/scripts cohort contains audited comments or docstrings that obscure current behavior with repetition, obvious narration, duplicated explanation, or historical detail. The audit is pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`.\n\n## Approach\nEdit explanatory text only in this directory/subsystem cohort. Condense it to current, non-obvious rationale and constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `tests/scripts/test_observability_memory_9ea3.py:1-22, 151-162, 237-245, 282-294, 372-383, 410-417, 461-468` — Preserve measured/pessimistic host values, bounded service dimensions, parse-health heartbeat, and bounded non-streaming census. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/test_observability_mirror_sync_bff5.py:1-16, 150-177` — Preserve every-path heartbeat, pessimistic comparison failure, and absent-log publication. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/test_observability_rotation_2dc7.py:1-13` — Preserve shrink detection, zero publication, and offset rebasing. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/test_reconciler_core_seam_clean_heldout.py:1-29, 45-51, 85-93, 298-304, 324-332, 357-364, 428-434` — Preserve ownership census, live kill-switches, root precedence, wheel fallback, and actionable failure. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/test_reconciler_jira_seam_clean_heldout.py:1-32` — Preserve Jira seam-clean contract and live-per-call credential fallback. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/test_residual_drain_seam_clean_heldout.py:1-50, 83-85` — Preserve exact residual ownership outcomes and eight legitimate in-place reads. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/test_reviewbot_entrypoint.py:61-70` — Preserve OpenSSH requirement and the unsigned-event failure mode. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/test_skill_mutation_sandbox_rule.py:1-17, 29-31, 52-55, 168-174` — Preserve mandatory sandboxing, self-contained profiles, scratch binding, and removal-sensitive rule checks. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/test_store_snapshot_io_seam_clean_heldout.py:1-20` — Preserve observable zero-exception seam-clean contract. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/test_summarize_ci_failures.py:1-15` — Preserve failure categorization while retaining the Gerrit message envelope. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/test_ticket_unblock.py:1-22, 32-37, 58-69, 133-151, 170-218, 237-261, 359-412, 434-450, 525-595, 774-793, 846-855, 888-900` — Preserve dependency direction, batch single-pass behavior, hidden-dir exclusion, and tombstone precedence/fallback. Consumer: none found.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest tests/scripts/test_observability_memory_9ea3.py tests/scripts/test_observability_mirror_sync_bff5.py tests/scripts/test_observability_rotation_2dc7.py tests/scripts/test_reconciler_core_seam_clean_heldout.py tests/scripts/test_reconciler_jira_seam_clean_heldout.py tests/scripts/test_residual_drain_seam_clean_heldout.py tests/scripts/test_reviewbot_entrypoint.py tests/scripts/test_skill_mutation_sandbox_rule.py tests/scripts/test_store_snapshot_io_seam_clean_heldout.py tests/scripts/test_summarize_ci_failures.py tests/scripts/test_ticket_unblock.py`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","id":"d8c3-771d-0164-4b25","parent_id":"2d43-3c39-307e-4450","priority":3,"repos":["rebar"],"tags":["comments","documentation","maintainability","grouped-remediation"],"ticket_type":"task","title":"Condense comments in tests/scripts — cohort 03: observability_memory_9ea3–ticket_unblock"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1788571163514027128,"uuid":"0b190807-cbfc-4bc8-852d-e1dcd7379e4a"}